        "A": "noun",
        "B": "adverb",
        "C": "adjective",
        "D": "independent"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "trap": "Mengikuti verb, dikira adverb.",
      "explanation": "Ia menjadi objek 'heard'; fungsi noun."
