        "A": "adjective",
        "B": "noun",
        "C": "independent",
        "D": "adverb"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "trap": "Mengandung finite verb 'found'.",
      "explanation": "Menerangkan noun 'analyst' = adjective clause."
    },
    {
